 -272.0855407714844], "id": 193, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [188], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["373a4ed087cd7a237c9a8e99e58a3e4ae527c794958547974a52a1b70c34fa00.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [337.4581604003906, 326], "pos": [1.3023099899291992, 45.387393951416016], "id": 115, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.65", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [293], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [574.3082275390625, 431.5450744628906], "pos": [-87.90967559814453, 438.72802734375], "widgets_values": ["# 核心任务\n基于【上传的参考照片】，生成一个高分辨率的 3×3 照片网格（共 9 张独立照片）。\n\n# 1. 尺寸与分辨率规范 (Technical Specifications)\n- **网格布局**：3行 × 3列 (3x3 Grid)\n- **单图尺寸目标**：1024 × 1024 像素 (Per Panel)\n- **全图总尺寸**：3072 × 3072 像素 (Total Canvas)\n- **画质要求**：原生 3K 分辨率输出，确保每个子网格中的面部细节在 100% 放大时依然清晰锐利，无噪点。\n\n# 2. 绝对一致性约束 (Identity Consistency)\n所有 9 个画面必须【100% 像素级】保留参考图中的以下特征：\n- **人物身份**：完全相同的五官比例、骨相结构。\n- **发型与发色**：锁定发型细节，禁止任何改变。\n- **服装**：锁定服装款式、颜色、材质。\n- **背景**：纯色或极简摄影棚背景，统一色调。\n\n# 3. 表情网格定义 (9种指定情绪)\n请严格按以下顺序在网格中生成对应表情：\n- [1. 左上] **大喜**：开怀大笑，露齿，眼睛笑成弯月。\n- [2. 中上] **愤怒**：眉头紧锁，眼神犀利，怒视。\n- [3. 右上] **悲伤**：眼眶含泪，嘴角下撇，神情委屈。\n- [4. 左中] **惊讶**：瞪大眼睛，张嘴，难以置信。\n- [5. 中中] **疑惑**：挑眉，歪头思考，眼神充满疑问。\n- [6. 右中] **恐惧**：瞳孔收缩，身体后仰，惊慌失措。\n- [7. 左下] **厌恶**：皱鼻，撇嘴，仿佛闻到异味。\n- [8. 中下] **鄙视/无语**：翻白眼 (Rolling eyes) 或面无表情的死鱼眼。\n- [9. 右下] **调皮**：吐舌头，眨眼 (Wink)，做鬼脸。\n\n# 4. 构图规范 (Composition)\n- **景别**：统一为【头部特写 (Headshot)】或【肩部以上 (Shoulder-up)】，保证面部填满 1024px 宽度的 60% 以上。\n- **光照**：柔和影棚光，避免面部出现因网格分割导致的阴影不一致。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 192, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "apikey", "links": [185], "label": "apikey", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "apikey"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["zhenzhen", "", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "api_base"}, "name": "api_base", "label": "api_base", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "api_base"}, {"widget": {"name": "apikey"}, "name": "apikey", "label": "apikey", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "apikey"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_ip"}, "shape": 7, "name": "custom_ip", "label": "custom_ip", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_ip"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Comfly_api_set", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 106], "pos": [515.538330078125, 654.4246215820312], "id": 111, "properties": {"ver": "2607ea71e5269ced450802a7872f773a3e7cc87e", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "T8mars/Comfyui-zhenzhen", "Node name for S&R": "Comfly_api_set"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["注意要输入api才有效\n贞贞的API注册：https://ai.t8star.cn/register?aff=cbff0534884\n目前0.2积分一个图,暂时1K,2K,4K价格一样"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [284.60247802734375, 117.55081939697266], "pos": [806.8175659179688, 676.6535034179688], "id": 109, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "node_versions": {"comfyui-inpainteasy": "1.0.2", "comfy-core": "0.3.24"}, "ds"